# inc-jkyf: a creature with WATER_BREATHING must be treated like an amphibian
# by deep water (no Swim roll, no drowning, no warning prompt). Wear the Ring of
# Elemental Command (Water), which grants WATER_BREATHING through its EA_GRANT
# (lib/m_items.irh:5113), then place one square of deep water east of the
# player and step into it. Read by tools/check_water_breathing.sh.
#   ring-on   the ring is on a finger (the grant is the ring's).
#   pool      the deep water square exists east of the player.
#   prompt    the screen right after the step east: the "Confirm enter the deep
#             water?" prompt must NOT be there.
#   entered   y answers the prompt only if one showed (@while).
#   steps     two more steps east, so a Swim check or drowning would print.

@include chargen.keys

w
y
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*26
@until "Ring of Item Preservation" DOWN
ENTER
m
SPACE
@dump:ring-on
ESC

w
@choose "Change terrain type"
RIGHT ENTER
@choose "deep water"
@dump:pool

RIGHT
@dump:prompt
@while "Confirm enter the deep water" y
@dump:entered
RIGHT
RIGHT
@dump:steps

@quit
